Emberpeak Dragonfire Flame Strike Player Units
    Events
        Time - Every (Random real number between 10.00 and 20.00) seconds of game time
    Conditions
    Actions
        -------- ===============COLOSSUS (CENTER) DRAGONS=============== --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Random integer number between 1 and 2) Equal to 1
            Then - Actions
                -------- ===============CENTER DRAGON 1 --------
                Set VariableSet EmberpeakDragonCasting[1] = True
                Set VariableSet VarPoint = (Position of (Random unit from (Units in DragonFireSpam01 <gen> matching ((Race of (Matching unit)) Equal to Orc))))
                -------- Breath of Fire --------
                Unit - Order Red Dragon (High Height) 1904 <gen> to Human Blood Mage - Flame Strike VarPoint
                Set VariableSet DragonSoundUnit = Red Dragon (High Height) 1904 <gen>
                Trigger - Run Dragon Sounds <gen> (checking conditions)
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_VarPoint)
                Wait 2.00 seconds
                Set VariableSet EmberpeakDragonCasting[1] = False
            Else - Actions
